  "description": "Cuemon.Kernel provides the essential Cuemon programming substrate, including validators, conditions, decorators, configuration abstractions, asynchronous option types, disposable patterns, and core text encoding helpers. It is the minimal foundational layer for the Cuemon ecosystem and an addition to the System namespace.",
